    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d271">

                <pb facs="0357" n="264" xml:id="pg264"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.154/816: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Sack</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-10-04T15:00:00-05:00">October 4, 1935—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>37. Your despatch 864, September 23. The Department does not consider that this
                    Government should endeavor to dissuade the Costa Rican Government from taking
                    the steps it believes it should take prior to accepting the assistance proffered
                    by the United States.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
